# Lendefi Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Lendefi.

Lendefi is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a DeFi lending, token, vesting and LP lockup smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Lendefi  
Audit type: DeFi protocol, token, vesting and LP lockup smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

